          "Connect VO+ and VO- to the marked speaker pads and tighten the two amplifier terminal screws before mounting the amplifier.",
          "Keep the two leads in separate layers under the controller pin rows. Route the longer positive lead outside the speaker mounting screw before returning over the keeper opening to its pad.",
          "Mount the prewired amplifier on the detached cap before fitting controller/Pi; place the speaker cage without trapping the two leads."
        ],
